#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:1986
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>This application only knows which files or folders should be acted on "
"if they are <emphasis>selected</emphasis> first. Press this to toggle a "
"<emphasis>Selection Mode</emphasis> which makes selecting and deselecting as "
"easy as pressing an item once.</para><para>While in this mode, a quick "
"access bar at the bottom shows available actions for the currently selected "
"items.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovaj program zna koje fajlove ili fascikle treba obraditi samo ako su "
"oni prvo <emphasis>izabrani</emphasis>. Pritisnite ovo da biste uključili "
"<emphasis>režim izbora</emphasis>, koji omogućava biranje i poništavanje "
"izbora jednim pritiskom.</para><para>Dok je ovaj režim uključen, traka za "
"brzi pristup na dnu prikazuje dostupne radnje za trenutno izabrane stavke.</"
"para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2009
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid "This selects all files and folders in the current location."
msgstr "Ovo bira sve fajlove i fascikle na trenutnoj lokaciji."

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2013 dolphinpart.cpp:169
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu Edit"
msgid "Invert Selection"
msgstr "Izvrni izbor"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2015
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis invert"
msgid ""
"This selects all items that you have currently <emphasis>not</emphasis> "
"selected instead."
msgstr ""
"Ovo umesto toga bira sve stavke koje trenutno <emphasis>niste</emphasis> "
"izabrali."

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2035
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis split"
msgid ""
"<para>This presents a second view side-by-side with the current view, so you "
"can see the contents of two folders at once and easily move items between "
"them.</para><para>The view that is not \"in focus\" will be dimmed. </"
"para>Click this button again to close one of the views."
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovo otvara drugi prikaz pored trenutnog, tako da možete istovremeno "
"videti sadržaj dve fascikle i lako premeštati stavke između njih.</"
"para><para>Prikaz koji nije „u fokusu“ biće zatamnjen.</para>Ponovo kliknite "
"na ovo dugme da zatvorite jedan od prikaza."

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2050
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"If the view has been split, this will pop the view in focus out into a new "
"window."
msgstr ""
"Ako je prikaz podeljen, ovo će izdvojiti prikaz u fokusu u novi prozor."

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2058
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:intoolbar Stash"
msgid "Stash"
msgstr "Spremi"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2059
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Opens the stash virtual directory in a split window"
msgstr "Otvara virtuelnu fasciklu za spremanje u podeljenom prozoru"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2068
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Refresh view"
msgstr "Osveži prikaz"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2070
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis refresh"
msgid ""
"<para>This refreshes the folder view.</para><para>If the contents of this "
"folder have changed, refreshing will re-scan this folder and show you a "
"newly-updated view of the files and folders contained here.</para><para>If "
"the view is split, this refreshes the one that is currently in focus.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovo osvežava prikaz fascikle.</para><para>Ako se sadržaj ove fascikle "
"promenio, osvežavanje će ponovo učitati fasciklu i prikazati vam ažurirani "
"prikaz fajlova i fascikla koji se ovde nalaze.</para><para>Ako je prikaz "
"podeljen, ovo osvežava onaj koji je trenutno u fokusu.</para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2077
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu View"
msgid "Stop"
msgstr "Zaustavi"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2078
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Stop loading"
msgstr "Zaustavi učitavanje"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2079
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "This stops the loading of the contents of the current folder."
msgstr "Ovo zaustavlja učitavanje sadržaja trenutne fascikle."

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2084
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu Navigation Bar"
msgid "Editable Location"
msgstr "Urediva lokacija"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2086
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"This toggles the <emphasis>Location Bar</emphasis> to be editable so you can "
"directly enter a location you want to go to.<nl/>You can also switch to "
"editing by clicking to the right of the location and switch back by "
"confirming the edited location."
msgstr ""
"Ovo čini <emphasis>traku lokacije</emphasis> uredivom, tako da možete "
"direktno uneti lokaciju na koju želite da odete.<nl/>Takođe možete prebaciti "
"na uređivanje klikom desno od lokacije, a vratiti se potvrđivanjem izmenjene "
"lokacije."

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2094
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu Navigation Bar"
msgid "Replace Location"
msgstr "Zameni lokaciju"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2099
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"This switches to editing the location and selects it so you can quickly "
"enter a different location."
msgstr ""
"Ovo prebacuje na uređivanje lokacije i bira je, tako da možete brzo uneti "
"drugu lokaciju."

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2129
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu File"
msgid "Undo close tab"
msgstr "Opozovi zatvaranje jezička"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2130
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis undo close tab"
msgid "This returns you to the previously closed tab."
msgstr "Ovo vas vraća na prethodno zatvoreni jezičak."

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2138
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"This undoes the last change you made to files or folders.<nl/>Such changes "
"include <interface>creating</interface>, <interface>renaming</interface> and "
"<interface>moving</interface> them to a different location or to the "
"<filename>Trash</filename>. <nl/>Any changes that cannot be undone will ask "
"for your confirmation beforehand."
msgstr ""
"Ovo opoziva poslednju izmenu koju ste napravili u fajlovima ili fasciklama."
"<nl/>Takve izmene uključuju <interface>stvaranje</interface>, "
"<interface>preimenovanje</interface> i <interface>premeštanje</interface> na "
"drugu lokaciju ili u <filename>Smeće</filename>.<nl/>Za bilo kakve izmene "
"koje se ne mogu opozvati, biće prethodno tražena vaša potvrda."

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2148
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"This redoes the last change you undid.<nl/>Such changes include "
"<interface>creating</interface>, <interface>renaming</interface> and "
"<interface>moving</interface> files or folders to a different location or to "
"the <filename>Trash</filename>.<nl/>Any changes that cannot be undone will "
"ask for your confirmation beforehand."
msgstr ""
"Ovo ponavlja poslednju izmenu koju ste opozvali.<nl/>Takve izmene uključuju "
"<interface>stvaranje</interface>, <interface>preimenovanje</interface> i "
"<interface>premeštanje</interface> fajlova ili fascikli na drugu lokaciju "
"ili u <filename>Smeće</filename>.<nl/>Za bilo kakve izmene koje se ne mogu "
"opozvati, biće prethodno tražena vaša potvrda."

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2177
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Go to your <filename>Home</filename> folder.<nl/>Every user account has "
"their own <filename>Home</filename> that contains their personal files, as "
"well as hidden folders for their applications' data and configuration files."
msgstr ""
"Idite u svoju <filename>domaću</filename> fasciklu.<nl/>Svaki korisnički "
"nalog ima svoju <filename>domaću</filename> fasciklu koja sadrži lične "
"fajlove, kao i skrivene fascikle za podatke i postavne fajlove programa."

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2184
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu Tools"
msgid "Compare Files"
msgstr "Uporedi fajlove"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2190
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu Tools"
msgid "Manage Disk Space Usage"
msgstr "Upravljaj upotrebom prostora na disku"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2198
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>This opens a preferred search tool for the viewed location.</"
"para><para>Use <emphasis>More Search Tools</emphasis> menu to configure it.</"
"para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovo otvara željenu alatku za pretragu za prikazanu lokaciju.</"
"para><para>Koristite meni <emphasis>Više alatki za pretragu</emphasis> da je "
"podesite.</para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2212
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu Tools"
msgid "Open Terminal"
msgstr "Otvori terminal"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2214
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>This opens a <emphasis>terminal</emphasis> application for the viewed "
"location.</para><para>To learn more about terminals use the help features in "
"the terminal application.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovo otvara program <emphasis>terminala</emphasis> za prikazanu "
"lokaciju.</para><para>Da biste saznali više o terminalima, koristite "
"mogućnosti pomoći u samom terminalu.</para>"

#. i18n: "Here" refers to the location(s) of the currently selected item(s) or the currently viewed location if nothing is selected.
#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2222
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu Tools"
msgid "Open Terminal Here"
msgstr "Otvori terminal ovde"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2224
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>This opens <emphasis>terminal</emphasis> applications for the selected "
"items' locations.</para><para>To learn more about terminals use the help "
"features in the terminal application.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovo otvara programe <emphasis>terminala</emphasis> za lokacije "
"izabranih stavki.</para><para>Da biste saznali više o terminalima, koristite "
"mogućnosti pomoći u samom terminalu.</para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2232
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:menu"
msgid "&Bookmarks"
msgstr "O&beleživači"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2242
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>This switches between having a <emphasis>Menubar</emphasis> and having "
"an <interface>%1</interface> button. Both contain mostly the same actions "
"and configuration options.</para><para>The Menubar takes up more space but "
"allows for fast and organized access to all actions an application has to "
"offer.</para><para>The %1 button is simpler and small which makes triggering "
"advanced actions more time consuming.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovo omogućava prebacivanje između <emphasis>trake menija</emphasis> i "
"dugmeta <interface>%1</interface>. Oba sadrže uglavnom iste radnje i opcije "
"postave.</para><para>Traka menija zauzima više prostora, ali omogućava brz i "
"organizovan pristup svim radnjama koje program nudi.</para><para>Dugme %1 je "
"jednostavnije i manje, što čini da pokretanje naprednih radnji iziskuje više "
"vremena.</para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2267
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu"
msgid "Go to Tab %1"
msgstr "Idi na jezičak %1"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2280
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu"
msgid "Last Tab"
msgstr "Poslednji jezičak"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2281
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu"
msgid "Go to Last Tab"
msgstr "Idi na poslednji jezičak"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2287
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu"
msgid "Next Tab"
msgstr "Sledeći jezičak"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2288
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu"
msgid "Go to Next Tab"
msgstr "Idi na sledeći jezičak"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2294
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu"
msgid "Previous Tab"
msgstr "Prethodni jezičak"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2295
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu"
msgid "Go to Previous Tab"
msgstr "Idi na prethodni jezičak"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2302
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu"
msgid "Show Target"
msgstr "Prikaži cilj"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2308
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu"
msgid "Open in New Tab"
msgstr "Otvori u novom jezičku"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2313
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu"
msgid "Open in New Tabs"
msgstr "Otvori u novim jezičcima"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2318
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu"
msgid "Open in New Window"
msgstr "Otvori u novom prozoru"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2323 panels/places/placespanel.cpp:45
#: tests/placespaneltest.cpp:125 tests/placespaneltest.cpp:147
#: tests/placespaneltest.cpp:169
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu"
msgid "Open in Split View"
msgstr "Otvori u podeljenom prikazu"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2335
#, kde-format
msgid "&Window Color Scheme"
msgstr "Šema boja pro&zora"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2348
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu Panels"
msgid "Unlock Panels"
msgstr "Otključaj panele"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2350
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu Panels"
msgid "Lock Panels"
msgstr "Zaključaj panele"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2353
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"This switches between having panels <emphasis>locked</emphasis> or "
"<emphasis>unlocked</emphasis>.<nl/>Unlocked panels can be dragged to the "
"other side of the window and have a close button.<nl/>Locked panels are "
"embedded more cleanly."
msgstr ""
"Ovo omogućava prebacivanje između <emphasis>zaključanih</emphasis> i "
"<emphasis>otključanih</emphasis> panela.<nl/>Otključani paneli se mogu "
"prevući na drugu stranu prozora i imaju dugme za zatvaranje.<nl/>Zaključani "
"paneli su čistije ugnežđeni."

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2362
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Information"
msgstr "Podaci"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2385
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>To show or hide panels like this go to <interface>Menu|Panels</"
"interface> or <interface>View|Panels</interface>.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Da biste prikazali ili sakrili ovakve panele, idite na <interface>Meni|"
"Paneli</interface> ili <interface>Prikaz->Paneli</interface>.</para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2392
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para> This toggles the <emphasis>information</emphasis> panel at the right "
"side of the window.</para><para>The panel provides in-depth information "
"about the items your mouse is hovering over or about the selected items. "
"Otherwise it informs you about the currently viewed folder.<nl/>For single "
"items a preview of their contents is provided.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovo omogućava prikazivanje ili skrivanje <emphasis>panela sa podacima</"
"emphasis> na desnoj strani prozora.</para><para>Panel pruža detaljne "
"informacije o stavkama preko kojih se nalazi pokazivač miša ili o izabranim "
"stavkama. U suprotnom, on vas obaveštava o trenutno prikazanoj fascikli.<nl/"
">Za pojedinačne stavke prikazuje se pregled njihovog sadržaja.</para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2400
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>This panel provides in-depth information about the items your mouse is "
"hovering over or about the selected items. Otherwise it informs you about "
"the currently viewed folder.<nl/>For single items a preview of their "
"contents is provided.</para><para>You can configure which and how details "
"are given here by right-clicking.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovaj panel pruža detaljne informacije o stavkama preko kojih se nalazi "
"pokazivač miša ili o izabranim stavkama. U suprotnom, on vas obaveštava o "
"trenutno prikazanoj fascikli.<nl/>Za pojedinačne stavke prikazuje se pregled "
"njihovog sadržaja.</para><para>Desnim klikom možete podesiti koji će se "
"detalji ovde prikazivati i kako.</para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2409
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Folders"
msgstr "Fascikle"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2429
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"This toggles the <emphasis>folders</emphasis> panel at the left side of the "
"window.<nl/><nl/>It shows the folders of the <emphasis>file system</"
"emphasis> in a <emphasis>tree view</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Ovo omogućava prikazivanje ili skrivanje <emphasis>panela fascikli</"
"emphasis> na levoj strani prozora.<nl/><nl/>On prikazuje fascikle "
"<emphasis>fajl sistema</emphasis> u <emphasis>prikazu stabla</emphasis>."

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2434
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>This panel shows the folders of the <emphasis>file system</emphasis> "
"in a <emphasis>tree view</emphasis>.</para><para>Click a folder to go there. "
"Click the arrow to the left of a folder to see its subfolders. This allows "
"quick switching between any folders.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovaj panel prikazuje fascikle <emphasis>fajl sistema</emphasis> u "
"<emphasis>prikazu stabla</emphasis>.</para><para>Kliknite na fasciklu da "
"biste otišli u nju. Kliknite na strelicu levo od fascikle da vidite njene "
"potfascikle. Ovo omogućava brzo prebacivanje između bilo koje dve fascikle.</"
"para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2444
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window Shell terminal"
msgid "Terminal"
msgstr "Terminal"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2470
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>This toggles the <emphasis>terminal</emphasis> panel at the bottom of "
"the window.<nl/>The location in the terminal will always match the folder "
"view so you can navigate using either.</para><para>The terminal panel is not "
"needed for basic computer usage but can be useful for advanced tasks. To "
"learn more about terminals use the help features in a standalone terminal "
"application like Konsole.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovo omogućava prikazivanje ili skrivanje <emphasis>panela terminala</"
"emphasis> na dnu prozora.<nl/>Lokacija u terminalu će uvek odgovarati "
"prikazu fascikle, tako da se možete kretati pomoću bilo kojeg od njih.</"
"para><para>Panel terminala nije potreban za osnovno korišćenje računara, ali "
"može biti koristan za napredne zadatke. Da biste saznali više o terminalima, "
"koristite mogućnosti pomoći u samostalnom programu terminala kao što je "
"Konsole.</para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2478
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>This is the <emphasis>terminal</emphasis> panel. It behaves like a "
"normal terminal but will match the location of the folder view so you can "
"navigate using either.</para><para>The terminal panel is not needed for "
"basic computer usage but can be useful for advanced tasks. To learn more "
"about terminals use the help features in a standalone terminal application "
"like Konsole.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovo je <emphasis>panel terminala</emphasis>. On se ponaša kao normalan "
"terminal, ali će odgovarati lokaciji prikaza fascikle, tako da se možete "
"kretati pomoću bilo kojeg od njih.</para><para>Panel terminala nije potreban "
"za osnovno korišćenje računara, ali može biti koristan za napredne zadatke. "
"Da biste saznali više o terminalima, koristite mogućnosti pomoći u "
"samostalnom programu terminala kao što je Konsole.</para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2488 dolphinmainwindow.cpp:3166
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu Tools"
msgid "Focus Terminal Panel"
msgstr "Fokusiraj panel terminala"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2489
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Move keyboard focus to and from the Terminal panel."
msgstr "Pomeri fokus tastature u panel terminala i iz njega."

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2495
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:inmenu"
msgid "Follow Directory Switch"
msgstr "Prati promenu fascikle"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2497
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Determines if current working directory must be kept in sync with terminal "
"whenever directory is changed."
msgstr ""
"Određuje da li trenutna radna fascikla mora biti usklađena sa terminalom kad "
"god se fascikla promeni."

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2513
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Places"
msgstr "Mesta"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2541
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item:inmenu"
msgid "Show Hidden Places"
msgstr "Prikaži skrivena mesta"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2545
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"This displays all places in the places panel that have been hidden. They "
"will appear semi-transparent and allow you to uncheck their \"Hide\" "
"property."
msgstr ""
"Ovo prikazuje sva mesta u panelu mesta koja su skrivena. Ona će biti "
"poluprovidna i omogućiće vam da odznačite njihovo svojstvo „Sakrij“."

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2557
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>This toggles the <emphasis>places</emphasis> panel at the left side of "
"the window.</para><para>It allows you to go to locations you have bookmarked "
"and to access disk or media attached to the computer or to the network. It "
"also contains sections to find recently saved files or files of a certain "
"type.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovo omogućava prikazivanje ili skrivanje <emphasis>panela mesta</"
"emphasis> na levoj strani prozora.</para><para>On vam omogućava da idete na "
"mesta koja ste obeležili i da pristupite diskovima ili medijima priključenim "
"računaru ili mreži. Takođe sadrži odeljke za pronalaženje nedavno sačuvanih "
"fajlova ili fajlova određenog tipa.</para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2564
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>This is the <emphasis>Places</emphasis> panel. It allows you to go to "
"locations you have bookmarked and to access disk or media attached to the "
"computer or to the network. It also contains sections to find recently saved "
"files or files of a certain type.</para><para>Click on an entry to go there. "
"Click with the right mouse button instead to open any entry in a new tab or "
"new window.</para><para>New entries can be added by dragging folders onto "
"this panel. Right-click any section or entry to hide it. Right-click an "
"empty space on this panel and select <interface>Show Hidden Places</"
"interface> to display it again.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovo je <emphasis>panel mesta</emphasis>. On vam omogućava da idete na "
"mesta koja ste obeležili i da pristupite diskovima ili medijima priključenim "
"računaru ili mreži. Takođe sadrži odeljke za pronalaženje nedavno sačuvanih "
"fajlova ili fajlova određenog tipa.</para><para>Kliknite na unos da biste "
"otišli u njega. Umesto toga, kliknite desnim dugmetom miša da biste otvorili "
"bilo koji unos u novom jezičku ili novom prozoru.</para><para>Novi unosi se "
"mogu dodati prevlačenjem fascikla na ovaj panel. Desnim klikom na bilo koji "
"odeljak ili unos možete ga sakriti. Kliknite desnim dugmetom miša na prazan "
"prostor na ovom panelu i izaberite <interface>Prikaži skrivena mesta</"
"interface> da biste ih ponovo prikazali.</para>"

