"Ne mogu da kopiram u drugi prikaz: nemate dozvolu za pisanje u odredišnu "
"fasciklu."

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2741
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Cannot move to other view: You do not have permission to write into the "
