#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2992
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>This is the <emphasis>Menubar</emphasis>. It provides access to "
"commands and configuration options. Left-click on any of the menus on this "
"bar to see its contents.</para><para>The Menubar can be hidden by unchecking "
"<interface>Settings|Show Menubar</interface>. Then most of its contents "
"become available through a <interface>Menu</interface> button on the "
"<emphasis>Toolbar</emphasis>.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovo je <emphasis>traka menija</emphasis>. Ona omogućava pristup "
"naredbama i opcijama postave. Kliknite levim dugmetom miša na bilo koji od "
"menija na ovoj traci da vidite njegov sadržaj.</para><para>Traku menija "
"možete sakriti tako što ćete odznačiti <interface>Postavke->Prikaži traku "
"menija</interface>. Tada većina njenog sadržaja postaje dostupna putem "
"dugmeta <interface>Meni</interface> na <emphasis>traci alatki</emphasis>.</"
"para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:2999
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>This is the <emphasis>Toolbar</emphasis>. It allows quick access to "
"frequently used actions.</para><para>It is highly customizable. All items "
"you see in the <interface>Menu</interface> or in the <interface>Menubar</"
"interface> can be placed on the Toolbar. Just right-click on it and select "
"<interface>Configure Toolbars…</interface> or find this action within the "
"<interface>menu</interface>.</para><para>The location of the bar and the "
"style of its buttons can also be changed in the right-click menu. Right-"
"click a button if you want to show or hide its text.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovo je <emphasis>traka alatki</emphasis>. Ona omogućava brz pristup "
"najčešće korišćenim radnjama.</para><para>Veoma je prilagodljiva. Sve stavke "
"koje vidite u <interface>meniju</interface> ili na <interface>traci menija</"
"interface> mogu se postaviti na traku alatki. Samo kliknite desnim dugmetom "
"miša na nju i izaberite <interface>Podesi trake alatki...</interface> ili "
"pronađite ovu radnju unutar <interface>menija</interface>.</"
"para><para>Položaj trake i stil njenih dugmadi takođe se mogu promeniti u "
"meniju koji se pojavljuje desnim klikom. Kliknite desnim dugmetom miša na "
"dugme ako želite da prikažete ili sakrijete njegov tekst.</para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:3011
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis main view"
msgid ""
"<para>Here you can see the <emphasis>folders</emphasis> and <emphasis>files</"
"emphasis> that are at the location described in the <interface>Location Bar</"
"interface> above. This area is the central part of this application where "
"you navigate to the files you want to use.</para><para>For an elaborate and "
"general introduction to this application <link url='https://userbase.kde.org/"
"Dolphin/File_Management#Introduction_to_Dolphin'>click here</link>. This "
"will open an introductory article from the <emphasis>KDE UserBase Wiki</"
"emphasis>.</para><para>For brief explanations of all the features of this "
"<emphasis>view</emphasis> <link url='help:/dolphin/dolphin-view.html'>click "
"here</link> instead. This will open a page from the <emphasis>Handbook</"
"emphasis> that covers the basics.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovde možete videti <emphasis>fascikle</emphasis> i <emphasis>fajlove</"
"emphasis> koji se nalaze na lokaciji opisanoj u <interface>traci lokacije</"
"interface> iznad. Ova oblast je centralni deo ovog programa gde se krećete "
"do fajlova koje želite da koristite.</para><para>Za detaljan i opšti uvod u "
"ovaj program <link url='https://userbase.kde.org/Dolphin/"
"File_Management#Introduction_to_Dolphin'>kliknite ovde</link>. Ovo će "
"otvoriti uvodni članak sa <emphasis>KDE UserBase Wiki</emphasis> stranice.</"
"para><para>Za kratka objašnjenja svih mogućnosti ovog <emphasis>prikaza</"
"emphasis>, umesto toga <link url='help:/dolphin/dolphin-view.html'>kliknite "
"ovde</link>. Ovo će otvoriti stranicu iz <emphasis>Priručnika</emphasis> "
"koja pokriva osnove.</para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:3027
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>This opens a window that lists the <emphasis>keyboard shortcuts</"
"emphasis>.<nl/>There you can set up key combinations to trigger an action "
"when they are pressed simultaneously. All commands in this application can "
"be triggered this way.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovo otvara prozor koji prikazuje <emphasis>prečice na tastaturi</"
"emphasis>.<nl/>Tamo možete postaviti kombinacije tastera za pokretanje "
"radnje kada se oni pritisnu istovremeno. Sve naredbe u ovom programu mogu se "
"pokrenuti na ovaj način.</para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:3033
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>This opens a window in which you can change which buttons appear on "
"the <emphasis>Toolbar</emphasis>.</para><para>All items you see in the "
"<interface>Menu</interface> can also be placed on the Toolbar.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovo otvara prozor u kojem možete promeniti koja se dugmad pojavljuju "
"na <emphasis>traci alatki</emphasis>.</para><para>Sve stavke koje vidite u "
"<interface>meniju</interface> takođe se mogu postaviti na traku alatki.</"
"para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:3037
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"This opens a window where you can change a multitude of settings for this "
"application. For an explanation of the various settings go to the chapter "
"<emphasis>Configuring Dolphin</emphasis> in <interface>Help|Dolphin "
"Handbook</interface>."
msgstr ""
"Ovo otvara prozor gde možete promeniti mnoštvo postavki za ovaj program. Za "
"objašnjenje različitih postavki, idite na poglavlje <emphasis>Podešavanje "
"Dolphina</emphasis> u <interface>Pomoć|Priručnik za Dolphin</interface>."

#. i18n: If the external link isn't available in your language it might make
#. sense to state the external link's language in brackets to not
#. frustrate the user. If there are multiple languages that the user might
#. know with a reasonable chance you might want to have 2 external links.
#. The same might be true for any external link you translate.
#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:3057
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis handbook"
msgid ""
"<para>This opens the Handbook for this application. It provides explanations "
"for every part of <emphasis>Dolphin</emphasis>.</para><para>If you want more "
"elaborate introductions to the different features of <emphasis>Dolphin</"
"emphasis> <link url='https://userbase.kde.org/Dolphin/File_Management'>click "
"here</link>. It will open the dedicated page in the KDE UserBase Wiki.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovo otvara Priručnik za ovaj program. On pruža objašnjenja za svaki "
"deo <emphasis>Dolphina</emphasis>.</para><para>Ako želite detaljnije uvode u "
"različite mogućnosti <emphasis>Dolphina</emphasis>, <link url='https://"
"userbase.kde.org/Dolphin/File_Management'>kliknite ovde</link>. Ovo će "
"otvoriti namensku stranicu na KDE UserBase Wiki stranici.</para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:3062
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis whatsthis button"
msgid ""
"<para>This is the button that invokes the help feature you are using right "
"now! Click it, then click any component of this application to ask \"What's "
"this?\" about it. The mouse cursor will change appearance if no help is "
"available for a spot.</para><para>There are two other ways to get help: The "
"<link url='help:/dolphin/index.html'>Dolphin Handbook</link> and the <link "
"url='https://userbase.kde.org/Dolphin/File_Management'>KDE UserBase Wiki</"
"link>.</para><para>The \"What's this?\" help is missing in most other "
"windows so don't get too used to this.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovo je dugme koje pokreće mogućnost pomoći koju trenutno koristite! "
"Kliknite na njega, a zatim kliknite na bilo koju komponentu ovog programa da "
"pitate „Šta je ovo?“ o njoj. Pokazivač miša će promeniti izgled ako pomoć za "
"određeno mesto nije dostupna.</para><para>Postoje još dva načina da dobijete "
"pomoć: <link url='help:/dolphin/index.html'>Priručnik za Dolphin</link> i "
"<link url='https://userbase.kde.org/Dolphin/File_Management'>KDE UserBase "
"Wiki</link>.</para><para>Pomoć „Šta je ovo?“ nedostaje u većini ostalih "
"prozora, tako da se ne navikavajte previše na ovo.</para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:3073
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>This opens a window that will guide you through reporting errors or "
"flaws in this application or in other KDE software.</para><para>High-quality "
"bug reports are much appreciated. To learn how to make your bug report as "
"effective as possible <link url='https://community.kde.org/Get_Involved/"
"Bug_Reporting'>click here</link>.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovo otvara prozor koji će vas voditi kroz prijavljivanje grešaka ili "
"mana u ovom programu ili u drugom KDE softveru.</para><para>Kvalitetni "
"izveštaji o greškama su veoma cenjeni. Da biste saznali kako da vaš izveštaj "
"o grešci učinite što efikasnijim, <link url='https://community.kde.org/"
"Get_Involved/Bug_Reporting'>kliknite ovde</link>.</para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:3082
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>This opens a <emphasis>web page</emphasis> where you can donate to "
"support the continued work on this application and many other projects by "
"the <emphasis>KDE</emphasis> community.</para><para>Donating is the easiest "
"and fastest way to efficiently support KDE and its projects. KDE projects "
"are available for free therefore your donation is needed to cover things "
"that require money like servers, contributor meetings, etc.</"
"para><para><emphasis>KDE e.V.</emphasis> is the non-profit organization "
"behind the KDE community.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovo otvara <emphasis>veb stranicu</emphasis> na kojoj možete donirati "
"kako biste podržali nastavak rada na ovom programu i mnogim drugim "
"projektima <emphasis>KDE</emphasis> zajednice.</para><para>Doniranje je "
"najlakši i najbrži način da efikasno podržite KDE i njegove projekte. KDE "
"projekti su besplatni, pa je vaša donacija potrebna za pokrivanje troškova "
"kao što su serveri, sastanci doprinosilaca itd.</para><para><emphasis>KDE e."
"V.</emphasis> je neprofitna organizacija koja stoji iza KDE zajednice.</para>"

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:3095
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"With this you can change the language this application uses.<nl/>You can "
"even set secondary languages which will be used if texts are not available "
"in your preferred language."
msgstr ""
"Pomoću ovoga možete promeniti jezik koji ovaj program koristi.<nl/>Čak "
"možete postaviti i pomoćne jezike koji će se koristiti ako tekstovi nisu "
"dostupni na vašem primarnom jeziku."

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:3100
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"This opens a window that informs you about the version, license, used "
"libraries and maintainers of this application."
msgstr ""
"Ovo otvara prozor koji vas informiše o verziji, licenci, korišćenim "
"bibliotekama i održavaocima ovog programa."

#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:3105
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"This opens a window with information about <emphasis>KDE</emphasis>. The KDE "
"community are the people behind this free software.<nl/>If you like using "
"this application but don't know about KDE or want to see a cute dragon have "
"a look!"
msgstr ""
"Ovo otvara prozor sa informacijama o <emphasis>KDE‑u</emphasis>. KDE "
"zajednica su ljudi koji stoje iza ovog slobodnog softvera.<nl/>Ako vam se "
"sviđa korišćenje ovog programa, ali ne znate za KDE ili želite da vidite "
"slatkog zmaja, pogledajte!"

